      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "worker  (rq SimpleWorker)\n\nLoads model once at boot:\n  • Ettin-150m safetensors\n  • ~574 MB resident\n\nPer job:\n  1. BLPOP from queue\n  2. tokenize + softmax\n  3. write result to redis",
