      "text": "Legend:   ▮ amber = external client / model artifact     ▮ blue = service container     ▮ red = redis / queue\n           ▮ green = offline pipeline     ▭ dashed = boundary or read-only volume     ⋯ dotted = data lineage\n\nSteady-state latency: ~150 ms (POST /api/predict/sync) → 90 ms inference + 25 ms avg poll + 30 ms HTTP + 5 ms misc",
